{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1354801-combining-aptitudes","id":1354801,"title":"Combining Aptitudes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-13T12:12:12-08:00","id":1354801,"title":"Combining Aptitudes","content":"The table of effects and modifiers you get when combining Aptitudes is awesome and all, but I feel like it overshadows this little paragraph in the Psi section that deceptively packs a huge punch of possibility-<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>\u00c6on page 207</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Psions can also combine their abilities to take advantage<br /> of each Aptitude\u2019s specialties and open new<br /> ways to use their powers. This can produce otherwise<br /> impossible effects. For example, biokinetics \u2014<br /> who can only use their powers on themselves \u2014 can<br /> combine with vitakinetics to access the noetic templates<br /> of others and shapeshift them. If a clairsentient<br /> joined this group, the biokinetic could even<br /> attempt this shape shifting at range.</div> </div> </div> </div>What are some other great combinations? It seems like BK and VK have some of the most immediate and obvious uses since they also have some of the most obvious limitations, only on yourself or by touch naturally, respectively.<br /> <br /> To get the ball rolling, as a Telepath combine with a Vitakinetic to activate Mind Shield in others. Not groundbreaking, but handy.<br /> <br /> Bonus Challenge: Is there an Aptitude that can already phase through walls, and if not, what combination would get you there? I was thinking maybe VK or BK to change/manipulate yourself or others, but I wasn't sure what to combine with, QK maybe?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":1542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","user":"MoroseMorgan","date":". 12-13-2019, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T12:26:00-08:00","id":1354803,"title":"","content":"QK: Transmutation lets you walk through walls at 4 dots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T12:57:13-08:00","id":1354808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1354801-combining-aptitudes?p=1354803#post1354803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">QK: Transmutation lets you walk through walls at 4 dots.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aha, although that's the other way around, you make the wall phase-able, but it only affects non-living matter.<br /> <br /> So you could combine Transmutation 4 with VK to allow your bodies to phase instead of the wall. Pepper in Telepath and Clairsentient so that your group can do it at range without touching.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T17:01:33-08:00","id":1354832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1354801-combining-aptitudes#post1354801\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The table of effects and modifiers you get when combining Aptitudes is awesome and all, but I feel like it overshadows this little paragraph in the Psi section that deceptively packs a huge punch of possibility-</div> </div> </div> </div>The table for the effects of combining Aptitudes is on the following page, 208. The characters in the opening fiction, <i>Unity</i>, take advantage of this capability, such as when Sachi (a vitakinetic) and Rahmat (a teleporter) combined powers to help Rahmat teleport a room full of people.<br /> <br /> The ability to combine effects in this way was inspired by Horror Benefits from Orpheus, described on Orpheus p.99. For example, by spending a point of Vitality, a Banshee with Wail can double the range, area of effect, or number of targets of a circle-mate's Horror. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-14T00:32:26-08:00","id":1354861,"title":"","content":"Quick combinations.<br /> Clair + any sensory base power = use it remotely<br /> Clair + other powers use on targets you have connection as long it\u2019s on the 500 times reach<br /> BK + QK = Use QK directly on biological targets<br /> EK + PK = total control over infra red spectrum<br /> QK + EK or PK = Energy conversion<br /> EK + QK = Focused gravitational rays<br /> PK + EK = sonic cannons<br /> BK + Teleport = remote poison / feromonal injection <br /> VK + Teleport + Clair = Mass Heal / Raise dead","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-14T18:21:53-08:00","id":1354949,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1354801-combining-aptitudes?p=1354861#post1354861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quick combinations.<br /> Clair + any sensory base power = use it remotely<br /> Clair + other powers use on targets you have connection as long it\u2019s on the 500 times reach<br /> BK + QK = Use QK directly on biological targets<br /> EK + PK = total control over infra red spectrum<br /> QK + EK or PK = Energy conversion<br /> EK + QK = Focused gravitational rays<br /> PK + EK = sonic cannons<br /> BK + Teleport = remote poison / feromonal injection <br /> VK + Teleport + Clair = Mass Heal / Raise dead</div> </div> </div> </div>BK won\u2019t let you alter any template except your own without combining with VK.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T12:18:53-08:00","id":1356140,"title":"","content":"While listening to the Polyhedron Podcasts \u00c6on \u00c6uctual Pl\u00e6y this one dawned on me.<br /> <br /> Teleporter using Blink on behalf of their linked compatriots when combined with a Telepath, a clairsentient, and a Vitakinetic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-21T15:37:08-08:00","id":1356378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1354801-combining-aptitudes?p=1356140#post1356140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While listening to the Polyhedron Podcasts \u00c6on \u00c6uctual Pl\u00e6y this one dawned on me.<br /> <br /> Teleporter using Blink on behalf of their linked compatriots when combined with a Telepath, a clairsentient, and a Vitakinetic.</div> </div> </div> </div>In that case:<br /> <br /> Teleport 1 (Translocation 1, for Blink),<br /> Telepathy 1 (Mindshare 1, for Network at least and the secondary effect of affecting people with powers),<br /> Clairsentience 2 (Psycholocation 2, for Dowsing to know where everyone is and also again the secondary effect is really, really nice) - I take it Psycholocation 1 wouldn't be enough, right? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Vitakinese 2 (Iatrosis 2, for Accelerate - sure not the whole hog in regards to the noetic template, but Blink isn't the highest power either, so that should even out)<br /> I'd probably even go down to Iatrose 1 and match the Teleport and Vitakinese level with each other, which sounds better for me all things considered.<br /> <br /> In any case, if a sole Teleporter tries this... that would be a Proxy tier Psion and a Beast to deal with.<br /> Four specialized Psions could emulate the effect rather easily on their own.<br /> A Psiad would need some work, but could get it running with some effort and work put in.<br /> <br /> Sound about right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9298-bhurano","name":"Bhurano","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T08:44:51-08:00","id":1356484,"title":"","content":"That\u2019s one thing that makes me happy about the system... this crazy possibility is completely supported by the rules...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T21:12:41-08:00","id":1356583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bhurano</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1354801-combining-aptitudes?p=1356378#post1356378\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In that case:<br /> <br /> Teleport 1 (Translocation 1, for Blink),<br /> Telepathy 1 (Mindshare 1, for Network at least and the secondary effect of affecting people with powers),<br /> Clairsentience 2 (Psycholocation 2, for Dowsing to know where everyone is and also again the secondary effect is really, really nice) - I take it Psycholocation 1 wouldn't be enough, right? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Vitakinese 2 (Iatrosis 2, for Accelerate - sure not the whole hog in regards to the noetic template, but Blink isn't the highest power either, so that should even out)<br /> I'd probably even go down to Iatrose 1 and match the Teleport and Vitakinese level with each other, which sounds better for me all things considered.<br /> <br /> In any case, if a sole Teleporter tries this... that would be a Proxy tier Psion and a Beast to deal with.<br /> Four specialized Psions could emulate the effect rather easily on their own.<br /> A Psiad would need some work, but could get it running with some effort and work put in.<br /> <br /> Sound about right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Can't combine auxiliary modes as per p 209, so slight damper on the proxy shenanigans.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm curious how others feel about Clairsentience expanding range for Psiads. Strict reading, only psions linking with a clear get that work around, but I could see Psycholocation maybe granting that for psiads.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T21:40:21-08:00","id":1356587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1354801-combining-aptitudes?p=1356583#post1356583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can't combine auxiliary modes as per p 209, so slight damper on the proxy shenanigans.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, was Bhurano talking about a single psion combining their own powers for the boost? No, that doesn\u2019t work at all. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1354801-combining-aptitudes?p=1356583#post1356583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Also, I'm curious how others feel about Clairsentience expanding range for Psiads. Strict reading, only psions linking with a clear get that work around, but I could see Psycholocation maybe granting that for psiads.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn\u2019t. Psiads don\u2019t get the Aptitude-specific boosts, period.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}